1
00:00:05,570 --> 00:00:06,540
Good morning.

2
00:00:06,540 --> 00:00:08,380
(Sheldon:)If I could have everyone's
attention, please?

3
00:00:08,380 --> 00:00:11,780
(Sheldon:)I know we're all eager
to get on the road to Big Sur,

4
00:00:11,780 --> 00:00:14,350
(Sheldon:)so if we focus, I'm sure we can
get through this orientation

5
00:00:14,350 --> 00:00:15,850
(Sheldon:)in under a half an hour.

6
00:00:16,820 --> 00:00:19,290
(Sheldon:)Then it's just Q&A,
quiz, safety drills,

7
00:00:19,290 --> 00:00:22,460
(Sheldon:)pose for commemorative
group photo and we're off.

8
00:00:22,460 --> 00:00:25,260
(Leonard:)Don't worry. Just sit
next to me during the quiz,

9
00:00:25,260 --> 00:00:27,560
(Leonard:)and you can copy my answers.

10
00:00:27,570 --> 00:00:28,770
(Sheldon:)Raj?

11
00:00:28,770 --> 00:00:29,970
(Sheldon:)What are you doing?

12
00:00:30,740 --> 00:00:32,470
(Sheldon:)I don't think so.

13
00:00:33,340 --> 00:00:35,240
(Sheldon:)You've had your allotted
six ounces.

14
00:00:35,240 --> 00:00:38,380
(Sheldon:)The first bathroom break
isn't until the Denny's

15
00:00:38,380 --> 00:00:41,210
(Sheldon:)located near Bakersfield,

16
00:00:41,210 --> 00:00:44,180
(Sheldon:)which is approximately
two and half hours away.

17
00:00:44,180 --> 00:00:48,120
(Sheldon:)Remember, people, we're only as
strong as our weakest bladder.

18
00:00:49,520 --> 00:00:53,520
(Howard(after Raj whispers to him):)Nobody cares about
your Kegel exercises.

19
00:00:53,520 --> 00:00:57,630
(Sheldon:)All right. We have
seven people, and two cars.

20
00:00:57,630 --> 00:01:00,930
(Sheldon:)In the lead car,
driven by Leonard,

21
00:01:00,930 --> 00:01:04,170
(Sheldon:)will be... myself,

